OL,3,AAfghan women with UK university offers
OL,4,A'heartbroken' after visas stopped
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Shahira Sadat received an
OL,7,Finvitation for a Chevening Scholarship
OL,8,Finterview, she felt a rare glimmer of
OL,9,Fhope.
OL,11,FThe software engineer in Kabul had
OL,12,Fspent three years battling Taliban
OL,13,Frestrictions, jumping through hoops and
OL,14,Fworking through power and internet
OL,15,Foutages to prepare her applications for
OL,16,FUK universities and grants.
OL,18,F"I was so happy. I can't describe it
OL,19,Fbecause I allowed myself to dream about
OL,20,Fstudying in the UK," she says.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
