OL,3,AAfghan women with UK university offers
OL,4,A'heartbroken' after visas stopped
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in March this year, the UK's Home
OL,7,FOffice announced an "emergency visa
OL,8,Fbrake" on study visas for applicants
OL,9,Ffrom Cameroon, Myanmar, Sudan and
OL,10,FAfghanistan. Skilled work visas for
OL,11,FAfghans were also paused. It said the
OL,12,Fmove was a response to widespread visa
OL,13,Fabuse and had been triggered by a sharp
OL,14,Frise in asylum claims from these visa
OL,15,Froutes.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
